            {
                "comment": "Lydia was a very tough grader for tests. You literally had to have the exact words she wanted to get points. Class was way more work than any of my higher level classes. The material was interesting mostly but opposing views were never considered. I kind of felt like Lydia just was condescending and rude in her lectures",
                "difficulty_rating": 4,
                "quality_rating": 2
            },
            {
                "comment": "took a 1 credit seminar with her and oh man the amount of homework and reading she assigns for a 1 credit class is absurd. there's more homework in this class than some 3 credit courses i've taken. she's not a very warm person either. I also had to spend money on some materials for this seminar which i've never had to do before",
                "difficulty_rating": 5,
                "quality_rating": 2
            },
            {
                "comment": "Lydia is very passionate about the material covered. That being said, she also sees things very black and white. Does not really see the other side of things. Class seems more preachy than a presentation of facts at times. Material was interesting, but it got hard to pay attention. Final research presentation for this class.",
                "difficulty_rating": 4,
                "quality_rating": 2
