            {
                "comment": "Class is \"mandatory\" because she gives you pop quizzes nearly everyday. She's unapproachable and doesn't explain things in a helpful manner. Reads off of slides. Exams are nothing like the practice questions. Content is semi-interesting but it makes it hard to enjoy it when the professor conveys it in confusing way. Get to work on HW in groups.",
                "difficulty_rating": 4,
                "quality_rating": 2
